From: =?UTF-8?q?David=20Kneub=C3=BChler?= <dave@MBP-of-DKN.localdomain>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 14:47:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(web): add opt-in whole-stack selection

Add a "Select whole stack" toggle to bulk selection. It is off by
default, preserving upstream primary-only selection. When enabled,
selected stack primaries expand to all stack members before bulk
actions run, and actions abort if stack resolution fails.

Bake the public source URL into the web build through
PUBLIC_IMMICH_SOURCE_URL so login and shared-link pages offer the
corresponding source without changing the authenticated server about
endpoint.

Add focused web unit tests and stack-selection and source-link E2E
specs.
